WEBVTT

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:10.180
Excuse me, there's a strange man on the bus...

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.810
It smells... It smells!

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:26.240
<i>Will the sky one day grow tired of</i>
<i>looking down and lose its blue color?</i>

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:35.230
<i>There's just one blue sky over this</i>
<i>world rife with countless emotions</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.320
<i>The sound of the battle raging somewhere</i>

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:45.250
<i>And the laughter right nearby</i>

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:48.220
<i>You can never hear it all</i>

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:50.830
<i>Because you have only one story</i>

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:56.730
<i>Only this sky sees all at</i>
<i>once the sorrow and smiles</i>

00:00:56.730 --> 00:01:02.710
<i>That simultaneously fall in different</i>
<i>places around this wide world</i>

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:09.180
<i>Will the sky one day grow tired of</i>
<i>looking down and lose its blue color?</i>

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:15.050
<i>How can it stay unchanging after</i>
<i>watching innumerable dramas?</i>

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:21.290
<i>Even now everyone heads to his</i>
<i>own story without knowing a thing</i>

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:29.530
<i>There's just one blue sky over this</i>
<i>world rife with countless emotions</i>

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:40.700
<i>Wordlessly marking out</i>
<i>time longer than anyone's...</i>

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:58.730
What the hell?

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:02.600
Hey, what can I say? I'm eating for two.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.430
Yeah, right!

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:08.640
This is your body, isn't it?!
You're just being a glutton!

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:11.410
Allow me to explain, Tsutomu.

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:14.780
Birdy must ingest large amounts of Earth's food

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:18.110
in order to intake the amount
of energy she requires.

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:19.780
To put it in precise energy units...

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:21.650
That's not what I'm talking about!

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:23.120
Then what's the problem?

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.920
I'm sick of this!

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:28.520
You guys have totally made a mess of my life!

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:29.490
How so?

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:34.000
You ignore my plans, you talk to me
inside my head while we're in public...

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.800
At this rate, I'm just some weirdo!

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:41.840
We apologize, Tsutomu.
We do give your lifestyle first priority.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:42.940
Yeah!

00:02:42.940 --> 00:02:46.380
Then let me stay in my own body from now on.

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:49.850
Now wait a second! Obviously I can't do that!

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:52.720
I have a mission to capture the criminals!

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:55.450
That's got nothing to do with me.

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:57.850
This is your fault for destroying my body.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:03.730
I have a right to live my own life, don't I?

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:06.300
You do have a point, certainly.

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.360
- Of course.
- Tuto!

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:12.870
It's not ethically permissible to get
you mixed up in our investigation.

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:14.300
Hey!

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:17.170
That's my Tuto! You understand stuff!

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:19.310
Okay!

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:20.740
Then it's decided.

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:22.010
What is?

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:24.210
However, Tsutomu, I want you to understand

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:26.880
that if we don't capture the criminals quickly,

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:30.150
Earth will be in danger as well.

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:34.090
But still, I won't let you use
this body without my permission.

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:35.260
You'd better promise me!

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:36.690
Fine!

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:49.110
Birdy, you promised not to
change forms without permission.

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:51.240
It's because of what <i>you</i> said!

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:52.740
What are we supposed to do now?!

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:56.350
Because of that promise, we
won't be able to investigate properly!

00:03:56.350 --> 00:04:00.850
You have to think more seriously
about coexisting with him, Birdy.

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:02.290
Why should I?

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:06.920
I think you felt the decline in your
abilities during the fight with Bacillus.

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:08.790
You weren't imagining it.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:13.460
It was because you aren't
coexisting well with the boy inside of you.

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:14.700
At this rate, the worst-case scenario is...

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:16.600
I know that!

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:22.310
If mental fusion happens and I disappear,
Tsutomu can have my body.

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:23.610
Birdy...

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:26.710
I'm the one who killed him, after all...

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:30.080
Why would you say something so self-tormenting?

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:33.720
If you don't think more progressively,
nothing will be solved.

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:35.480
Enough lecturing!

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:38.590
I'm saying you and Tsutomu
need a trusting relationship to...

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:39.890
Enough!

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:41.160
Birdy...

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:45.230
If you hate me so much, just
become <i>Tsutomu's</i> Buddy instead!

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:47.230
Birdy...

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:49.670
No, I'm Tsutomu!

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:55.570
Birdy, I believe that your and
Tsutomu's hearts can connect.

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:58.170
And I'd like to do whatever I can to help.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:10.850
Now, eat up! Good health starts with breakfast!

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:12.840
Don't mind if I do!

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:15.630
Yum!

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:17.760
Eating properly is important for your health.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:21.750
I'll do my best to help you lead a comfortable life.

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:26.040
Here's your lunch!

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.470
It's huge!

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:31.840
Good for you, Tsutomu. What a
wonderful, handy partner you have.

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:32.830
Huh?

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:40.350
You seem like you're in a bad mood.

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:44.120
Nope. I thought you weren't
supposed to talk to me in public?

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:45.720
Did you say something?

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:47.220
Uh, no!

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:47.960
Huh?

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:48.990
What is it?

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:50.390
Nakasugi!

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:54.360
Hayamiya!

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:59.000
Is it okay for you to ride the bus to school?

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:01.630
Yep! I'm feeling pretty healthy.

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.680
Are you okay, Nakasugi?

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:14.550
I'm sorry! You're Senkawa, right?

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:17.250
Grab onto one of the handles.
It's dangerous otherwise.

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:19.060
Okay.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:22.050
Honestly, you're such a little rich girl.

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:27.660
Your heart rate's gone up.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:29.170
You get a hormone rush or something?

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:31.600
No I did <i>not</i> get a hormone rush!

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:33.200
What the hell?

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:35.600
Sorry, just talking to myself...

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:39.510
Senkawa is interesting, isn't he?

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:41.210
I guess.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:45.920
Miss Sayaka's health is so much better...

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:48.680
I'm very glad of it.

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:53.620
Miracles really do exist in this world...

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:56.960
Will you be heading to work now?

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:59.390
Yes. Have the car brought around.

00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:02.970
Thank goodness Nakasugi's looking so well, huh?

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:05.430
I was worried when I heard about the accident...

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:08.100
They say it was a pretty bad one, too.

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:10.610
Yeah, their car was totaled, right?

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.600
Lady Luck must be on her side.

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:17.710
Now that's one serious lunchbox.

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:20.550
Did you make this yourself?

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:23.890
O-Of course I did! I live alone.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:29.290
See, um, I've just been so hungry lately.
I'm a growing boy, you know.

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:33.460
It's great to be at the old
alma mater, eh Mr. Sumida?

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:37.670
Ah, the dream-filled days of my youth...

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:41.170
I was so enthusiastic about all
the journalism club's activities!

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:45.940
Fine, Muroto, I'll buy some, all right?

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:48.780
Thank you for your business as always.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:52.450
Listen, Muroto, if you're going to write,
write something that isn't trash.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:56.020
This stuff makes more money than real reportage.

00:07:56.020 --> 00:07:59.360
If it were really selling,
you wouldn't be coming to me!

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:01.160
The economy's bad these days...

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:06.600
Sheesh, Kaori's from the same club,
and she's doing good work!

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:13.840
Huh?

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.670
What is it?

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:19.440
Stand back!

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.340
Can we get in through this door?

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:24.480
Ah, if you're an employee,
please take the back entrance.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:26.220
Hey! Don't you go in there!

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:29.020
Aw, man... <i>he's</i> coming.

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:30.120
"He"?

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:33.390
Here he is. The Maharaja
graces us with his presence!

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:34.380
Huh?

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:38.790
Satyajit Shyamalan?

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:43.870
Yep. You just joined the company,
Ms. Sanada, so I guess you didn't know.

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.170
He's a vital partner of ours.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:47.160
Partner?

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:53.480
Mr. Moriyama, this is overkill.

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:58.310
We're merely expressing a small
token of our thanks for all you've done.

00:08:58.310 --> 00:09:01.910
I don't really like being greeted this way.

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:08.090
You can just treat me normally.

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:12.490
You're the one in charge of
interviewing him on the show today, right?

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:13.700
That's right.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:18.370
Well, be sure not to offend him.
I hear he got a producer fired recently.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.360
Huh...

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:19.770
"Irma's"

00:09:19.770 --> 00:09:22.200
Geega's disappeared.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:25.210
The way I hear it, Empire TV's
referring to him as fired.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:26.740
I see...

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:27.080
"Irma's"
I see...

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:31.110
I do know what apartment
Geega lived in, anyway, but...

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:32.380
What do you want to do?

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:36.090
We don't have much information.
I'd like to hear it.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:39.360
She doesn't do much of Shion's work these days...

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:46.130
We know, we know, we'll make you some
money with Shion as soon as this job is over.

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:47.030
Really?

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:51.130
The truth is, it looks like
Birdy actually likes this work!

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:53.870
And after we finish this case, we can get time off.

00:09:53.870 --> 00:09:57.870
Then once this investigation is over,
I can put Shion on TV, right?

00:09:57.870 --> 00:10:02.410
That's right, I suppose we won't
have to limit her exposure anymore.

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:05.880
Then let's put a CD out, too, and sell her like crazy!

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:08.420
We can make oodles of money!

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.490
What fun!

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:12.480
Shion and I will do our best!

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:17.790
It smells...

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:19.430
Hey, you!

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:21.830
What are you doing there?

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:24.460
Hey! Let me go! Let me out!

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:32.630
There's no sign that Geega's
returned to the apartment.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:43.620
There are various signs of Bacillus's presence...

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.090
Hmm? Are you listening, Birdy?

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:46.760
I'm listening!

00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:52.030
I'm currently in the bath, so I'm
cutting off communications now!

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:53.430
Bir...

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:55.030
You sure that was okay?

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:57.870
It's none of your business.

00:10:57.870 --> 00:11:01.370
What is this "Ryunka" that the
Geega guy is supposed to have?

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:03.040
Hazardous material.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.870
Hazardous how?

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:10.610
Don't tell me you don't know what it is?!

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:14.620
It doesn't matter! If I catch Geega and Bacillus...

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:16.220
That's so sloppy.

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:20.210
What am I supposed to do about it?!
Captain Megius didn't tell me!

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:27.130
How about you give the Ryunka back?

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:30.120
Maybe they've lost the Ryunka?

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:35.040
Did you find the Ryunka, Bacillus?

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:40.010
Don't call me that! I'm Giga! Giga!

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:45.680
All right, Mr. Giga. So, did you
come here just to introduce yourself?

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:52.350
Don't make fun of me. I'm here
because... hmm... why <i>am</i> I here?

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:55.160
What do you plan to do now?

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:57.990
I'll eat that Altan investigator.

00:11:57.990 --> 00:11:59.330
Oh ho.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:03.870
Plus, if I do that, I'll know
where the Ryunka is too!

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:07.040
You amaze me.

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:10.570
Want me to bring the Ryunka here when I find it?

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:14.880
Are you sure about that?
Don't you need to give it to Shyamalan?

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.910
I hate Shyamalan!

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:20.910
I'll take you over that bastard any day.

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:27.060
I'm grateful, but I'm embarrassed
to eat this in front of everybody.

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:30.530
Cute! How nice for you, Tsutomu.

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:33.200
Look, did something
happen between you and Tuto?

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:34.230
Nope.

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:36.100
Senkawa?

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.800
So here you are!

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:39.470
Were you looking for me?

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:42.910
Yep. Hayamiya! I found Senkawa!

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:44.270
Nakasugi, you're amazing!

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:47.710
Oh, Tsutomu! I've been looking for you!

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:49.380
Now, you mustn't forget your gym clothes!

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:50.150
Huh?

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:54.050
You have P.E. next period, right?
I'm so glad I made it in time!

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:55.650
Here you go.

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:59.590
Birdy, are you keeping your promise to Tsutomu?

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:01.090
No need to worry.

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.080
I'm glad for that!

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:07.230
Okay, do your best!

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:08.230
Tra la la la la!

00:13:08.230 --> 00:13:09.930
H-Hey!

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:14.340
Senkawa, I'll support you.
Don't worry about what other people think.

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:16.810
You sure you're not
misinterpreting something here?

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.970
You can come to me with
your problems if you want.

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:20.680
We're childhood friends, after all.

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:22.480
- Let's go, Nakasugi!
- Huh? Hey!

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:23.480
Senkawa.

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:24.310
Huh?

00:13:24.310 --> 00:13:27.620
He seemed interesting.
Introduce us next time, okay?

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:29.120
See you later.

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:31.250
H-Hey, wait a second!

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:32.820
Oh, a text.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:35.090
Kitamura?

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:38.760
Oh, crap, it's our turn to
set up for gym class today.

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:40.460
Nakasugi, I'm going to go on ahead!

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.450
Okay.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.290
Oh, man...

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:53.540
Bacillus.

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:57.010
You're the Altan's Marker, right?

00:13:57.010 --> 00:13:59.880
So she's definitely here.

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:02.870
Dammit, how long does it
take Senkawa to eat his lunch?

00:14:09.690 --> 00:14:11.690
It smells. It smells!

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:15.130
Huh, so the Altan's over there, eh?

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:20.140
Oh, so he's your big sister's friend?

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:23.010
Yeah. My sister's a real weirdo,

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:25.510
so a lot of her friends are
strange, too. It's a problem.

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:29.550
But you're lucky to have a sibling.

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:33.720
I'm an only child, so...

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.350
Oh, no, look at the time!

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:39.590
Senkawa, it's P.E. next period.
Don't you have to change clothes?

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:41.760
Oh, I guess so.

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:43.390
What about you?

00:14:43.390 --> 00:14:44.860
I just observe.

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:48.430
Oh, sorry. I forgot, you're not well...

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:51.070
It's okay. It's just the truth.

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:55.370
It'd be nice if I could join
you guys in P.E. someday...

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:56.940
Yeah.

00:14:56.940 --> 00:14:58.930
We have to get going.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:01.080
Shall we?

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.010
Yeah.

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:05.080
I'll eat you!

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:07.080
Nakasugi!

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:08.120
What's happening?!

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:10.520
Huh? I got the wrong one?

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:11.720
That guy...

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:12.790
Geega?

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:15.060
Yo, Altan.

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.260
You can't fool my nose.

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:21.700
If you don't want me to eat this Earthling,
then let me eat you!

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:25.270
C'mon, get over here so I can eat you!

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:28.300
I guess we can't switch bodies in front of her.

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:29.940
Obviously!

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:32.210
Then we'll do this with your body.

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:33.140
Huh?

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:35.410
Don't you want to save her?

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.710
Fine.

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:38.540
Here we go!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.220
Ow!

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:44.050
I'll eat you!

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:57.960
This is bad!

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:06.510
She's heavy!

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:11.610
Sheesh, Tsutomu, you have no muscles!
Do a little weight-lifting!

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:13.520
Mind your own business.

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:15.510
It looks like she's okay.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:19.090
She's cute!

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:20.860
But this is no time for
you to have a hormone rush.

00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:22.490
Like I would even do that!

00:16:22.490 --> 00:16:24.760
Okay, then, I'm going to change bodies.

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:26.460
If I don't capture Geega, everyone's in danger.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:27.860
Fine!

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:33.770
That must be Bacillus. He's eaten Geega.

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:35.700
Then he's the one who?

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:37.010
Exactly.

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:38.440
Ouch...

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:49.450
Ouch!

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:51.520
He's getting away!

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:55.020
Ugh, gross. I can't deal with that kind of thing.

00:16:55.020 --> 00:16:58.790
What are you talking about?!
He'll get away again if you don't hurry!

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:00.860
I wonder where Senkawa is?

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:02.830
He went off by himself again and...

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:04.820
Hey, has anyone seen Nakasugi?

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.140
Here?

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:15.540
Probably. I don't think there's
anyplace else he could hole up.

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:20.180
Looks like you're right.

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:23.170
This is perfect; nobody will see us here.

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:27.250
Where did he go?

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:30.690
Got you!

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:36.560
If I can't eat you, then just die!

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:52.780
This thing is useful.

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:04.630
This is not good!

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:06.460
I'll eat you.

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:14.240
Sorry to keep you waiting. My body
won't detach like it's supposed to.

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:15.700
Tuto!

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.940
You look awful.

00:18:17.940 --> 00:18:23.450
Bacillus gained more powers eating Geega.
This won't be like last time.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.550
Then what do we do?

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:28.080
Let me eat you!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.480
Capturing Bacillus is a difficult proposition.

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:43.500
So a blaster can't eliminate him, then?

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:50.110
Let me eat you!

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:58.280
Tuto!

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:00.910
Tuto?

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:04.150
Tuto, hang on!

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:08.760
Birdy, get Bacillus.

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:13.430
I'm gonna eat... Let me eat someone!

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:18.800
Birdy. Bacillus's memories have
all clouded. Even if you capture him,

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:21.370
you probably can't get information
about the Ryunka out of him.

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:22.700
Use this.

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:24.610
An Element Destructor?

00:19:24.610 --> 00:19:28.840
As your Marker, I grant you
permission to eliminate Bacillus.

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:32.480
If he stays on Earth,
there will be more casualties.

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:34.020
Now go on, get Bacillus.

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:36.010
I'll end this fast.

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:45.380
Let me eat! Let me eat...

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:55.200
A monster like you will get no food from me!

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:10.650
What was that?

00:20:10.650 --> 00:20:11.650
An explosion?

00:20:11.650 --> 00:20:13.050
In the pool?!

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:22.560
So you killed him? Good choice, Birdy Cephon.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:25.900
I won't let you get in my way, though.

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:29.540
You're a good Buddy, Birdy.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:32.070
Let's go back to our ship. If we do that...

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:37.710
I'm sorry to say this body is
broken past the point of repair.

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:41.920
If you leave, I'll be all alone again!

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:45.250
I wish I could have stayed with you longer.

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:50.260
This is goodbye... Birdy...

00:20:50.260 --> 00:20:52.090
Tuto...

00:20:54.460 --> 00:21:01.900
<i>Right now I can tell what kind of</i>
<i>connection Birdy and Tuto the robot had.</i>

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:06.900
<i>The sadness of losing a partner</i>
<i>that can never be replaced... a Buddy...</i>

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:11.410
Pleased to meet you, Birdy Cephon.

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:13.080
I am Tuto.

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:17.320
Starting today, I will be your Marker. Your Buddy.

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:18.620
"Buddy"?

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:22.120
Your partner. From now on, I'll always be with you.

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:24.750
Then I'll be <i>your</i> Buddy, huh Tuto?

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:43.810
<i>Let's go! Have a good time!</i>

00:21:43.810 --> 00:21:46.980
<i>A peaceful, happy</i>
<i>cheek-to-cheek time for everybody</i>

00:21:46.980 --> 00:21:52.980
<i>Put your hands, let's become one now</i>

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:01.260
<i>Come on, make some noise,</i>
<i>clap your hands, slap slap!</i>

00:22:01.260 --> 00:22:03.330
<i>Lift your hands, clap your hands, slap slap!</i>

00:22:03.330 --> 00:22:05.430
<i>Everyone has their worries</i>

00:22:05.430 --> 00:22:07.700
<i>Given they're neverending,</i>
<i>what'll you do from here on out?</i>

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:11.610
<i>Live out the tight days</i>
<i>without getting upset about it</i>

00:22:11.610 --> 00:22:14.280
<i>Am I right, or am I right?</i>

00:22:14.280 --> 00:22:16.280
<i>Everybody in the audience, lift your hands</i>

00:22:16.280 --> 00:22:20.150
<i>Don't cry anymore; come on, lift your head</i>

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>And show us your smile, okay?</i>

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:28.890
<i>Right now we're gonna forget all</i>
<i>about the hard, painful, and sad stuff</i>

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:33.130
<i>C'mon baby, c'mon baby, everybody yeah yeah</i>

00:22:33.130 --> 00:22:34.830
<i>Let's go! Have a new time!</i>

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:37.670
<i>Everybody give your best</i>
<i>good smile with all you've got</i>

00:22:37.670 --> 00:22:41.570
<i>Happy smile, everything'll become one now</i>

00:22:41.570 --> 00:22:43.200
<i>Let's go! Have a new world!</i>

00:22:43.200 --> 00:22:46.470
<i>Don't worry, I won't let go of your hand</i>

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.250
<i>I know it'll help you get through the future</i>

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:51.710
<i>Let's go! Have a good time!</i>

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:54.880
<i>A peaceful, happy</i>
<i>cheek-to-cheek time for everybody</i>

00:22:54.880 --> 00:22:58.890
<i>Put your hands, let's become one now</i>

00:22:58.890 --> 00:23:00.220
<i>Let's go! Have a good time!</i>

00:23:00.220 --> 00:23:03.690
<i>A peaceful, happy</i>
<i>cheek-to-cheek time for everybody</i>

00:23:03.690 --> 00:23:09.320
<i>Put your hands, let's become one now</i>

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:13.230
<i>This is Shion Arita, yessiree!</i>

00:23:13.230 --> 00:23:14.540
<i>Get this:</i>

00:23:14.540 --> 00:23:19.740
<i>next episode we're going to whiz</i>
<i>off to Birdy's planet in a spaceship!</i>

00:23:19.740 --> 00:23:23.910
<i>It has a bunch of aliens that look</i>
<i>like bugs and doggies and stuff!</i>

00:23:23.910 --> 00:23:27.550
<i>Birdy's friends are interesting, too, yessiree!</i>

00:23:27.550 --> 00:23:31.350
<i>But there are some creepy people, too...</i>

00:23:31.350 --> 00:23:34.290
<i>So Tsutomu is really shocked, yessiree!</i>

00:23:34.290 --> 00:23:36.020
<i>How cute!</i>

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:40.020
<i>But then Birdy gets in trouble again...!</i>
